Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.78,0:20:52.70,ED-JP0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1860,540)}今を生きるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.70,0:20:55.50,ED-JP0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1860,540)}君がいたから
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:21:02.17,ED-JP0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1860,540)}君が僕を見つけてくれた
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.17,0:21:07.42,ED-JP0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1860,540)}僕が僕であるしるし
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.88,0:19:48.35,ED-CN0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(60,540)}结局早已了然
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.35,0:19:52.81,ED-CN0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(60,540)}苍白空虚的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.81,0:19:59.77,ED-CN0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(60,540)}回荡在小小心灵
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.77,0:20:05.15,ED-CN0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(60,540)}这是我的专属宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.15,0:20:11.20,ED-CN0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(60,540)}无以言表的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.20,0:20:16.58,ED-CN0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(60,540)}也只能困在胸口
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.58,0:20:21.13,ED-CN0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(60,540)}无处宣泄
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.13,0:20:26.97,ED-CN0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(60,540)}找寻诞生的意义
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.97,0:20:29.85,ED-CN0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(60,540)}即使没有结果
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.85,0:20:34.98,ED-CN0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(60,540)}只愿心灵能在此依托
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.98,0:20:39.35,ED-CN0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(60,540)}这是唯一 唯一的愿望
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.35,0:20:44.07,ED-CN0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(60,540)}是你给予我生存的意义
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.07,0:20:49.78,ED-CN0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(60,540)}流逝的时间有了名字
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.78,0:20:52.70,ED-CN0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(60,540)}活在当下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.70,0:20:55.50,ED-CN0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(60,540)}只因有你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:21:02.17,ED-CN0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(60,540)}谢谢你找到了我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.17,0:21:07.42,ED-CN0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(60,540)}你就是我存在的证明
